# One dialogue for cryo_pod_1..4: NPC_NAME is the terminal's Name. Safe pod = free and not broken.
# Pods 1,2: free after PodFree(N). Pod 3: always free, broken until PodFixed(3). Pod 4: PodFree(4) or Killed(logan_faust).

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_1' && !HasFlag('PodFree(1)')
goto: Pod1Occupied

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_1'
goto: Pod1Free

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_2' && !HasFlag('PodFree(2)')
goto: Pod2Occupied

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_2'
goto: Pod2Free

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_3' && !HasFlag('PodFixed(3)')
goto: Pod3Broken

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_3' && HasFlag('PodOccupied(3)')
goto: Pod3Occupied

cond: NPC_NAME == 'cryo_pod_3'
goto: Pod3Free

cond: HasFlag('PodFree(4)') || HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
goto: Pod4Free

cond: true
goto: Pod4Reserved

%rec: Nodes

name: Pod1Occupied
npc: POD 1. Occupant: Henrik Vale, Chairman, Bushido-ArmaTech. Vitals nominal.
+ Frost on the glass; under it a face older than the file photo.
#
o_text: Pull the plug.
o_id: pull_plug_1
o_goto: Killed1
#
o_text: Leave him.
o_id: leave_pod_1
o_goto: End

name: Killed1
npc: The hum stops. The frost goes grey, then wet. Vitals: none.
+ POD 1: vacant.
effect: SetFlag('Killed(sleeper_1)')
effect: SetFlag('PodFree(1)')
effect: ProvokeFaction('faust')
#
o_text: (Step back.)
o_id: step_back_1
o_goto: End

name: Pod1Free
npc: POD 1: vacant. Systems nominal.
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_1
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_1
o_goto: End

name: Pod2Occupied
npc: POD 2. Occupant: Dr. Ilse Marrow, BAT Research. Vitals nominal.
+ Her hands are folded like she expected applause when she woke.
#
o_text: Pull the plug.
o_id: pull_plug_2
o_goto: Killed2
#
o_text: Leave her.
o_id: leave_pod_2
o_goto: End

name: Killed2
npc: The hum stops. The frost goes grey, then wet. Vitals: none.
+ POD 2: vacant.
effect: SetFlag('Killed(sleeper_2)')
effect: SetFlag('PodFree(2)')
effect: ProvokeFaction('faust')
#
o_text: (Step back.)
o_id: step_back_2
o_goto: End

name: Pod2Free
npc: POD 2: vacant. Systems nominal.
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_2
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_2
o_goto: End

name: Pod3Broken
npc: POD 3: FAULT. Primary fuse missing. The lid is up and nothing hums.
#
o_text: Insert the fuse.
o_id: insert_fuse
o_cond: HasItem('cryo_fuse')
o_goto: Fixed3
#
o_text: The coolant's still good. Bypass the fuse and dose the cryoprotectant by hand.
o_id: prime_pod_3
o_cond: !HasFlag('pod3_prime_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('biochemistry', 'Hard')
o_succ: Primed3
o_fail: PrimeFailed3
#
o_text: Climb in anyway.
o_id: climb_broken_3
o_goto: Refuses
#
o_text: Leave it.
o_id: leave_pod_3
o_goto: End

name: Fixed3
npc: The fuse seats with a click. Lights, then the hum. POD 3: nominal.
effect: RemoveItem('cryo_fuse')
effect: SetFlag('PodFixed(3)')
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_3_fixed
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_3_fixed
o_goto: End

name: Primed3
npc: You mix the glycol by eye and feed it in drop by drop. The lid hisses shut on its own. POD 3: nominal.
effect: SetFlag('PodFixed(3)')
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_3_primed
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_3_primed
o_goto: End

name: PrimeFailed3
npc: The mix clouds and crystallises in the line. The pod needs its fuse now.
effect: SetFlag('pod3_prime_failed')
#
o_text: Leave it.
o_id: prime_failed_leave
o_goto: End

name: Refuses
npc: The lid won't seal. No cold comes. You would wake as thawed meat, or never.
+ The pod refuses to start.
#
o_text: (Climb out.)
o_id: climb_out_3
o_goto: End

name: Pod3Occupied
npc: POD 3. Occupant: Henrik Vale, Chairman, Bushido-ArmaTech. Vitals nominal.
+ He never knew he moved.
#
o_text: Pull the plug.
o_id: pull_plug_3
o_goto: Killed3
#
o_text: Leave him.
o_id: leave_pod_3_occupied
o_goto: End

name: Killed3
npc: The hum stops. The frost goes grey, then wet. Vitals: none.
+ POD 3: vacant.
effect: SetFlag('Killed(sleeper_1)')
effect: ClearFlag('PodOccupied(3)')
effect: ProvokeFaction('faust')
#
o_text: (Step back.)
o_id: step_back_3
o_goto: End

name: Pod3Free
npc: POD 3: vacant. Systems nominal.
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_3
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_3
o_goto: End

name: Pod4Reserved
npc: POD 4: reserved. L. FAUST. Access denied.
#
o_text: Leave it.
o_id: leave_pod_4
o_goto: End

name: Pod4Free
npc: POD 4: vacant. Reservation released. Systems nominal.
#
o_text: Climb in.
o_id: climb_in_4
o_goto: ClimbIn
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: not_yet_4
o_goto: End

name: ClimbIn
npc: The lid seals. The cold comes in through the feet first.
effect: EndGame('cryo_sleep')

name: End
npc: The panel dims.
effect: EndConversation
